1
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:12,720
Out in the wilderness, middle of nowhere

2
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:15,680
No GPS signal, no food trucks to share

3
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:18,280
Jesus was teaching, the crowd kept growing

4
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:21,180
Families with children, the numbers were showing

5
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:24,000
Five thousand people, maybe even more

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,740
Kids getting cranky, parents getting sore

7
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:29,500
The sun's getting low and the hour is late

8
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:33,360
But where do you get food for this dinner date?

9
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:36,340
What you gonna do when you gotta feed a crowd?

10
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:39,100
And your pantry's empty, wallet's not too proud

11
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:41,900
No Walmart, no Costco, no Amazon Prime

12
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:44,740
Just empty stomachs and dinner time

13
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,480
What you gonna do?

14
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:50,300
When impossible seems to be staring at you!

15
00:00:54,190 --> 00:00:56,960
Disciples are panicking, doing the math

16
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:59,700
"Two hundred denarii won't clear this path!"

17
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:02,520
That's like a year's salary, maybe much more

18
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:05,420
To feed all these people by the lakeshore

19
00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:07,860
They searched through the crowd with a desperate plea

20
00:01:07,860 --> 00:01:10,660
"Anyone got food? We'll take what we see!"

21
00:01:10,660 --> 00:01:13,460
One little boy stepped up with a grin

22
00:01:13,460 --> 00:01:16,720
"I got five loaves and two fish - let's begin!"

23
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:20,280
What you gonna do when you gotta feed a crowd?

24
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:22,960
And your pantry's empty, wallet's not too proud

25
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:25,740
No Walmart, no Costco, no Amazon Prime

26
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:28,680
Just empty stomachs and dinner time

27
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:31,080
What you gonna do?

28
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:34,040
When impossible seems to be staring at you!

29
00:01:37,530 --> 00:01:40,960
Jesus took that lunch, just a humble man

30
00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:43,560
But holding in His hands the Creator's plan

31
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:46,280
He spoke one word, the laws of nature bent

32
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:49,060
The God who made the stars, Jesus was there

33
00:01:49,060 --> 00:01:51,860
Loaves multiplying by the power of His voice

34
00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:54,720
The One who fills the universe made His choice

35
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:57,440
Baskets overflowing, creation obeyed

36
00:01:57,440 --> 00:02:00,240
When the Word made flesh authority displayed!

37
00:02:03,470 --> 00:02:06,940
Now when life gets crazy and bills pile high

38
00:02:06,940 --> 00:02:09,760
When you lose your job and you wonder why

39
00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:12,400
We fumble around with our little plans

40
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:15,260
But Jesus holds the universe in His hands

41
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:17,920
Human efforts fail, our strength runs dry

42
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:20,580
But the Lord of heaven hears every cry

43
00:02:20,580 --> 00:02:23,220
When we're at our weakest, He shows His might

44
00:02:23,220 --> 00:02:28,480
The omnipotent Savior makes everything right!

45
00:02:29,070 --> 00:02:32,520
What you gonna do when you gotta feed a crowd?

46
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:35,040
When life gets heavy and troubles get loud

47
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:37,740
No human wisdom, no earthly plan

48
00:02:37,740 --> 00:02:40,540
Just Jesus standing as the God-man

49
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:43,280
What you gonna do?

50
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:47,420
The Creator of all things is here with you!

51
00:02:50,670 --> 00:02:53,540
Five loaves, two fish, and the Word made flesh

52
00:02:53,540 --> 00:02:56,420
The omnipotent God making all things fresh

53
00:02:56,420 --> 00:02:59,060
Behind simple eyes burns the power of stars

54
00:02:59,060 --> 00:03:03,500
The almighty Savior who heals all our scars!

55
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:07,640
What you gonna do?

56
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:11,360
Trust the God Jesus - infinite and true!
